    "body": "Alright, just running `starship` seems to resolve it. But still, it's not that doable. \r\nI've tried using a clean powershell profile as well, it doesn't seem to resolve the issue either.\r\n\r\n❯ starship bug-report\r\npkg_version:0.58.0\r\ntag:v0.58.0\r\ncommit_hash:0a60d1e9\r\nbuild_time:2021-09-21 13:43:39 +00:00\r\nbuild_env:rustc 1.55.0 (c8dfcfe04 2021-09-06),stable-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc (default)\r\n\r\nI am wondering though; could this be due to Windows Hyper-V Server 2016? ",
