    "updated_at": "2021-11-05T18:14:01Z",
    "body": "That's an interesting thought. I would personally be more likely to suspect older ConHost software on Windows 10 1607 (10.0.14393), since for it to be a Hyper-V bug would imply that the console does different things based on whether it's virtualized or not, but I'd need to obtain a build of that to really test that idea, and I don't know if that's possible for me to do.",
