    "updated_at": "2022-03-24T09:03:41Z",
    "body": "Just want to bump this to say I also see this. Interestingly after this happens (in Windows Terminal at least) lines of text stop rendering in places unless you highlight them or scroll, although scrolling causes other lines to disappear.\r\n\r\nI can't explain it very well so here is short video.\r\n![20220324090114_WindowsTerminal_qUakXWcqkq](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/9741849/159880368-fa721415-7221-4116-bcf0-f80ccba7fa7c.gif)\r\n\r\nAlso just to add to the original bug, it seems not every git pull or push for me causes this, only sometimes so getting a solid repro together is proving difficult.",
